---
source: crates/core/tests/apps.rs
expression: plan.render()
---
Bootcraft plan for Arch Linux (32 tasks)

[1/32] Colorful pacman output  (arch.pacman-tweaks)
    $ edit /etc/pacman.conf: enable Color in [options]
    $ edit /etc/pacman.conf: enable ILoveCandy in [options]

[2/32] Enable the multilib repository  (arch.multilib)
    $ edit /etc/pacman.conf: enable the [multilib] repository

[3/32] Update the system  (system.update)
    $ pacman -Syu --noconfirm

[4/32] Build tools (base-devel, git)  (arch.build-tools)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm base-devel git

[5/32] NVIDIA driver (open kernel modules)  (gpu.nvidia)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm nvidia-open  (skipped if NVIDIA-MODULE is already installed)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm nvidia-utils lib32-nvidia-utils

[6/32] Hardware video decoding on NVIDIA  (gpu.nvidia-vaapi)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm libva-nvidia-driver

[7/32] AUR helper (paru)  (arch.paru)
    $ build from the AUR as your user, then pacman -U: paru-bin  (skipped if paru, yay or pikaur is already installed)
    $ edit /etc/paru.conf: enable BottomUp in [options] (if the file exists)

[8/32] Flatpak with Flathub  (flatpak.flathub)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm flatpak
    $ flatpak remote-add --if-not-exists --system flathub https://dl.flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo

[9/32] Media codecs and thumbnails  (media.codecs)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm gst-libav gst-plugins-base gst-plugins-good gst-plugins-bad gst-plugins-ugly gst-plugin-va ffmpegthumbnailer

[10/32] Archive tools  (tools.archive)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm tar gzip zip unzip 7zip unrar

[11/32] NTFS and exFAT drives  (tools.drives)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm ntfs-3g exfatprogs

[12/32] Fonts for every language and emoji  (system.fonts)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm noto-fonts noto-fonts-cjk noto-fonts-emoji

[13/32] Firmware updates  (system.firmware)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm fwupd

[14/32] Blender (system package)  (app.blender)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm blender

[15/32] Krita (system package)  (app.krita)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm krita

[16/32] GIMP (system package)  (app.gimp)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm gimp

[17/32] Inkscape (system package)  (app.inkscape)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm inkscape

[18/32] Kdenlive (system package)  (app.kdenlive)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm kdenlive

[19/32] OBS Studio (system package)  (app.obs-studio)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm obs-studio

[20/32] FFmpeg (system package)  (app.ffmpeg)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm ffmpeg

[21/32] VSCodium (AUR)  (app.vscodium)
    $ build from the AUR as your user, then pacman -U: vscodium-bin

[22/32] Git (system package)  (app.git)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm git git-lfs

[23/32] GitHub CLI (system package)  (app.github-cli)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm github-cli

[24/32] Modern CLI tools (system package)  (app.cli-tools)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm ripgrep fd bat fzf eza zoxide jq btop tmux lazygit

[25/32] Podman & Distrobox (system package)  (app.podman)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm podman distrobox

[26/32] ComfyPilot (signed release)  (app.comfypilot)
    $ download comfypilot from its signed release (https://github.com/ArcticLatent/ComfyPilot/releases/latest/download/linux-release.json), verify it, install it

[27/32] Steam (system package)  (app.steam)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm steam

[28/32] Heroic (Flatpak)  (app.heroic)
    $ flatpak install -y --noninteractive --system flathub com.heroicgameslauncher.hgl

[29/32] ProtonPlus (Flatpak)  (app.protonplus)
    $ flatpak install -y --noninteractive --system flathub com.vysp3r.ProtonPlus

[30/32] MangoHud (system package)  (app.mangohud)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm mangohud lib32-mangohud

[31/32] GameMode (system package)  (app.gamemode)
    $ pacman -S --needed --noconfirm gamemode lib32-gamemode

[32/32] Remove KDE extras  (debloat.kde)
    $ pacman -Rns --noconfirm kmahjongg kmines kpat kolourpaint skanpage akregator kmail krdc krdp neochat krfb ktnef dragon elisa kamoso qrca (installed ones only)

A reboot is required afterwards.
